  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Visibility for the Ukrainian LGBTI community in the war times</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Representatives of nearly 10 LGBTQI organizations and initiatives from Ukraine are going to be present in Warsaw for the Pride March and Pride Events 2022 through the initiative &#x201C;KyivPride and WarsawPride marching together for peace&#x201D;

The activity aims to regain Ukrainian LGBTQI visibility in war times and to strengthen the image of the LGBTQI community as patriotic and supportive for Ukraine. In addition, it will help to build their capacity through networking and connections in Europe</narrative>
  </description>
